  "instructions": [
    "1. In a medium saucepan, bring 2 cups of oat milk to a simmer over medium heat.",
    "2. Add the rolled oats and cook, stirring frequently, until the oats have absorbed most of the milk and a creamy consistency forms.",
    "3. Stir in the Seoul chili flakes for added spice.",
    "4. Divide the cooked oat mixture into bowls.",
    "5. Top each bowl with diced Seoul Korean kimchi.",
    "6. Sprinkle Deopbap over the kimchi.",
    "7. Serve immediately."
